OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,FPolice have staged a "day of action"
OL,7,Famid a significant spike in death
OL,8,Fnumbers.
OL,10,FOfficers set up checkpoints on roads
OL,11,Facross the southern part of Northern
OL,12,FIreland on Tuesday, from Newcastle, Co
OL,13,FDown, across Co Armagh, part of Co
OL,14,FTyrone and Co Fermanagh to the border.
OL,16,FIt comes after the deaths of 42 people
OL,17,Fon Northern Ireland's roads to July
OL,18,F27, a significantly higher figure than
OL,19,Fto the same date in 2025 (27) and 2024
OL,20,F(35).
OL,26,@nD@VOUnD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/8
