FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,FSpeed was particularly highlighted as
OL,7,Fan area of concern, following the
OL,8,Falleged detection of a driver
OL,9,Ftravelling at more than 140mph on a
OL,10,Fmotorway last week.
OL,12,FPSNI South Area commander Chief
OL,13,FSuperintendent Norman Haslett said
OL,14,Fthat number of deaths in that time
OL,15,Fperiod in any other context would
OL,16,Fspark outcry.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,FSpeaking to media at a checkpoint on
OL,7,FConcession Road in Cullaville, Co
OL,8,FArmagh on Tuesday, Mr Haslett said
OL,9,FOperation Lifesaver is in response to
OL,10,Fthe "carnage" on our roads this year.
OL,12,F"I don't use the word carnage
OL,13,Flightly," he said.
OL,15,F"This year we have lost 42 people on
OL,16,Fthe roads of Northern Ireland as a
OL,17,Fresult of fatal road traffic
OL,18,Fcollisions, that is an appalling
OL,19,Fstatistic, it means that we're on
OL,20,Faverage experiencing a fatality on our
OL,21,Froads six times every month.
OL,26,@rD@EOUrD@MO]tD@AOUuD@IO]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,F"Once every five days police officers
OL,7,Fare knocking on doors to tell families
OL,8,Fthat their loved ones are gone.
OL,10,F"42 is not just a cold statistic,
OL,11,Fthese are people's lives, 42 people
OL,12,Fwho got up to do their daily business,
OL,13,Fand the devastation that that causes
OL,14,Fto their family, friends, their
OL,15,Fcommunity is absolutely immeasurable.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,F"I would contend that if we lost 42
OL,7,Fpeople in Northern Ireland in the time
OL,8,Fspan under any other circumstances, I
OL,9,Fwould say there would be a public
OL,10,Foutcry, but here in Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fwe seem to have some sort of a
OL,12,Fsocietal apathy, people think that
OL,13,Fit's just the norm. It is not the
OL,14,Fnormal."
OL,16,FMr Haslett called for reflection on
OL,17,Fthe number of deaths, their actions on
OL,18,Fthe road and the "fatal five" causes
OL,19,Fof collisions, including speeding.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@HO]zD@ROUzD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,FHe went on to reveal they caught a
OL,7,Fmotorist on a motorway driving at more
OL,8,Fthan 140mph, twice the national speed
OL,9,Flimit, adding that they had not been
OL,10,Fwearing a seat belt.
OL,12,F"People are driving too quickly, a
OL,13,Fspeed limit is what it is, a limit,
OL,14,Fnot a target, you should be driving
OL,15,Fsafely according to conditions on the
OL,16,Froad," he said.
OL,26,@tD@AOUxD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,F"People aren't wearing seatbelts,
OL,7,Fpeople are still getting behind the
OL,8,Fwheel while under the influence of
OL,9,Fboth alcohol and drugs. 50% of our
OL,10,Fdrug tests at the side of the road,
OL,11,Fwe're finding are positive.
OL,13,F"It's not good enough.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785417510
OL,3,CRoad safety crackdown after 'year of
OL,4,Ccarnage'
OL,6,F"People are not paying attention when
OL,7,Fthey're on the roads, people are
OL,8,Flooking at their mobile phones for
OL,9,Fmessages, and that split second people
OL,10,Ftake to look at their phone could be
OL,11,Fthe split second where something
OL,12,Fhappens and they're putting themselves
OL,13,Fand other road users at risk of
OL,14,Fserious injury or death."
OL,16,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,17,FITVX
OL,19,FSign up for our free weekly newsletter
OL,20,Fhere.
